C.41. aga nam-lugal-la₂-ka še-er-ga-an ma-ra-ni-in-dug₄#
#lem: aga[tiara]; namlugal[kingship]; šerkan[ornament]; dug[speak]
#tr.en: He has adorned you with a royal crown; 
#etcsl: line-id=C.41

C.42. ŋidru ud ul-le₂-a-ka zi nam-til₃-la-zu hu-mu-ni-ib₂#-sikil-le
#lem: ŋidru[scepter]; ud[sun]; ul[distant time]; zi[life]; namtil[life]; sikil[pure]
#tr.en: may he purify (?) your breath of life with an enduring sceptre!”} 
#etcsl: line-id=C.42

C.43. {d}ŋeštin-an-na nin₉ lugal-la-ke₄
#lem: Ŋeštinanak[1]DN; nin[sister]; lugal[king]
#tr.en: @q{“May @wDN{Geštin-ana}, the king's sister, 
